From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:23:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] build_features: indicate CONFIG_ROBUST_AV

A program that configures hostapd cannot tell whether the build holds
CONFIG_ROBUST_AV, which enable_dscp_policy_capa and the DSCP Policy
frames need. Answer "robust-av" in has_feature(), so that
`hostapd -vrobust-av` tells it.

Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
---
--- a/src/utils/build_features.h
+++ b/src/utils/build_features.h
@@ -73,6 +73,10 @@ static inline int has_feature(const char
 	if (!strcmp(feat, "interworking"))
 		return 1;
 #endif
+#ifdef CONFIG_ROBUST_AV
+	if (!strcmp(feat, "robust-av"))
+		return 1;
+#endif
 	return 0;
 }
 
